  "$comment": "Schema 3: physical setup in operation; solver settings in numerical. Named Monod growth [1/h] and uptake [mol/(kgDW h)] retain the original synthetic rates and yield. affinities.nutrient [mmol/L] is the former constants.half_saturation value, moved to a user-selectable parameter without changing its value. Concentration primitives use mmol/L; explicit mass factors are retained. Optional exponential-saturation correction: parameters.corrections.theta=0 [-] preserves the baseline. Each corrected substrate-dependent rate uses its own substrate and half-saturation concentration as the explicit reference scale (same concentration units). This scale choice is a configuration assumption, not a fitted correction. Derived balances and yields remain linked to these rates."
